re depressed; forward P/E was still ~116x. The right way to underwrite it i=
s EV/service gross profit and long-run margin normalization, not headline P=
/E.</p>
<p>Falsifiers: instrument vendors internalize calibration; self-calibrating=
 hardware substantially reduces external cycles; regulated customers bring =
calibration in-house; organic service growth stays low-single-digit despite=
 AI/automation capex.</p>
